  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat the oil in a wide pot, add the curry paste and stir for 30 seconds to open up the flavours. Add the chopped garlic and ginger and stir well."
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to the boil. Add the sweet potato, pumpkin and tofu (all cut into 3-4 cm cubes) and cook, covered, over medium-low heat for 20 minutes until the vegetables are tender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cauliflower, green beans, peas and broccoli, return to the boil and cook for another 3 minutes. Scatter with fresh basil and serve with rice."
    }
